                 <h2>Deadline Extended</h2>
                 <p>I&#8217;ve received some great submissions, but I would love to see more. If you&#8217;ve got an interesting story or essay, please do send it my way by <strong>June 15</strong>.</p>

<p>Did you ever cheat during a ballgame? Know someone who did? Or perhaps you&#8217;ve got a interesting take on cheating. If it&#8217;s compelling&#8212;be it a story, interview, essay or review&#8212;I&#8217;ll publish it.</p>

<p>You can send your submissions to <strong>editor @ thebaseballchronicle.com</strong> . Thanks.</p>

<p>* * * *</p>

<p>Also: Sorry about the inactivity on the site this week and last. My computer&#8217;s logic board failed last Wednesday night, leaving me without a computer for over a week. But all is now well.</p>

                 <p class="dateitalic">&mdash;June  5, 2009</p>
